{"last_link_id": 77, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [1586.3812255859375, 1323.5838623046875], "pos": [5087.38818359375, 272.15850830078125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 60, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 49, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [345.1251220703125, 484.70001220703125], "pos": [4241.6298828125, 308.55181884765625], "widgets_values": ["这是一份为您量身定制的【数字化服饰打样全案图】设计方案。我已将您的“名媛风、黑白玫红高饱和撞色、珊瑚绒材质”等需求，与工业级的CAD/CAM数字化裁剪标准完美结合。\n\n以下是为您生成的工业级 AI 绘画提示词（可直接用于 Midjourney v6 或 DALL-E 3 生成高精度设计图）：\n\n### 🎨 核心生成提示词 (Prompt)\n\n> **A highly detailed industrial fashion design spec sheet, vertical 9:16 layout, absolute pure white background #FFFFFF, shadowless, 2K resolution, masterpiece. Divided into three sections.** \n> **[Top 40% - Visual Display]:** A realistic fashion photography of a young elegant Chinese female model wearing a long tie-belt bathrobe and a triangular button-style hair towel cap. Style: Elegant socialite mixed with a subtle sexy vibe. Color palette: High saturation Black, White, and Rose Red color-blocking design. Material: Ultra-fine, thick, soft coral fleece with realistic rich texture and gloss. Small clear Chinese text labels \"名媛系列：成品效果\" in the top left, and a measurement line with text \"模特身高参考\". \n> **[Middle 25% - Structure]:** Flat lay technical drawings of the long bathrobe and hair cap, showing front, back, and side views. Clear details of the waist tie-belt and the button structure on the hair cap. Small clear Chinese text \"数字化结构拆解\" and \"CAD标准参考\". \n> **[Bottom 35% - CAD Cutting Pattern]:** 2D digital CAD cutting patterns for computer automated cutting bed (Auto-Marker Layout). Drawn with 1px thin closed black solid lines. Pattern pieces include: front panel, back panel, sleeves, belt, and triangular hair cap. Visible seam allowances and notches. High saturation color swatches of Black, White, and Rose Red. A vertical 0-150cm measuring scale ruler on the side. Small clear Chinese text annotations \"电脑裁床专用：裁剪样板与规格\", \"后身片*1\", \"袖片*2\", \"产品尺寸：均码L\". Clean, crisp lines, perfect for vector extraction. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0 --style raw\n\n---\n\n### 📐 数字化打样全案图解构说明：\n\n#### 1. 顶部：视觉展示区 (Top 40%)\n*   **主体形象**：一位气质出众的年轻中国模特，身着长款系带浴袍与配套的三角干发帽，展现25-45岁精致女性的“名媛风范”。\n*   **色彩与材质**：采用极具视觉冲击力的**高饱和黑、白、玫红**撞色设计（例如：大面积纯黑底色，搭配玫红色翻领与腰带，白色包边点缀）。材质呈现极致细腻的**珊瑚绒**，通过光影凸显其丰满的绒毛厚度与保暖光泽感。\n*   **工业标注**：左上角清晰标注中文“名媛系列：成品效果”，侧边附带“模特身高参考”的标尺线，方便打版师评估成衣垂坠感。\n\n#### 2. 中部：服饰结构区 (Middle 25%)\n*   **三视图平铺**：浴袍与干发帽的正面、背面、侧面结构图。\n*   **细节拆解**：重点放大展示“系带穿孔位置”、“门襟重叠量”以及干发帽尾部的“纽扣与挂绳”物理咬合结构。\n*   **工业标注**：横排醒目文字“数字化结构拆解”与“CAD标准参考”。\n\n#### 3. 底部：电脑裁床裁剪图解 (Bottom 35%)\n*   **排料图 (Marker)**：完全模拟 CAM 电脑自动裁床的排料逻辑，使用 **1px 纯黑细实线**在纯白背景上绘制封闭轮廓，无任何阴影杂质，确保后期可一键提取为 DXF/PLT 矢量文件。\n*   **裁片清单**：包含前衣片（左右对称）、后身片（一片式连裁）、袖片×2、腰带×1、贴袋×2、三角干发帽主体×1。\n*   **数字化特征**：每块裁片精准标注**缝份线 (Seam Allowance)** 与**对刀点 (Notches)**。紧贴裁片标注中文：“后身片*1”、“袖片*2”及“产品尺寸：均码L”。\n*   **辅助工具**：左侧放置 0-150cm 数字化比例尺，右下角附带黑、白、玫红三色高饱和色卡，底部标注“电脑裁床专用：裁剪样板与规格”。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.70